OL,3,GNEWSAWoman felt 'violated' sister's
OL,4,Amedical records were accessed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says her sister felt "violated"
OL,7,Fafter discovering her medical notes had
OL,8,Fbeen inappropriately accessed.
OL,10,FGemma Sabatino was seriously ill in a
OL,11,Fcritical care unit at Addenbrooke's
OL,12,FHospital in Cambridge, in November
OL,13,F2023, after suffering a mental health
OL,14,Fcrisis.
OL,16,FThe mother, who also worked as a
OL,17,Fhairdresser, was later diagnosed with
OL,18,Fbreast cancer and died aged 28 in June
OL,19,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
