OL,4,Amedical records were accessed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer sister Angelina said the family
OL,7,Fwere "disgusted". Cambridge University
OL,8,FHospitals confirmed three staff members
OL,9,Fwere dismissed "for inappropriately
OL,10,Faccessing Gemma's medical record".
